From f1607425744f957f487c2a99fbd90ac897284beb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Trust Corporation <vooflight5@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 17:44:53 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add URL links, expand file formats (XLS, JPG, PNG), and
 clipboard paste support

- Added dedicated URL/link input field with validation
- Support for multiple file formats: XLS, XLSX, JPG, JPEG, PNG, GIF, BMP, WEBP
- Implement paste-from-clipboard for images
- Enhanced pendingUpload store to handle URLs alongside files
- Improved UI with distinct styling for URL items
- All changes compile successfully without errors

Co-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>
---
 frontend/src/views/Home.vue | 194 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 180 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

